      "text": "How to hire people better than you:\n\n1—Clear most of your calendar\n2—List the most talented people you know\n3—Meet up with each one\n4—Paint a genuine vision and progress against it\n5—Explain their potential impact on the vision\n6—Listen &amp; be humble\n7—Repeat 3-6 every 2 months",
