        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 6
      },
      "text": "Perceptions have incredible compounding effects.\n\nFrom Rolf Harms wonderful “Economics of the Cloud” from 2010:\n\n“As positive use cases continue to spur more interest in cloud technology, this virtuous cycle will accelerate, driving greater interest in and acceptance\nof cloud.”",
