        "1198322491745193984"
      ],
      "id": "1198322491745193984",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 8,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 67,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 4,
        "retweet_count": 6
      },
      "text": "Confusing but true fact:\n\nThe people from whom I’ve benefited the most are not the ones who have tried to help me (w/advice, aid, etc). Instead, it is the ones who actively tried, but failed, to harm me.\n\nWe, as humans, respond far more violently to threats than encouragement.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1198322491745193984"
    },
