        "reply_count": 0,
        "retweet_count": 6
      },
      "text": "There is a fine line between conviction and intellectual honesty. \n\nSometimes everyone says you’re wrong, and you’re right. Those moments are fresh and invigorating.\n\nMore often, you’re wrong and everyone will tell you.\n\nTo be successful, you must be attuned to which is which.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1195382346587025408"
    },
