      "text": "New office for @scale_AI 🎉\n\nIt checks all the boxes:\n✅gradients\n✅more meeting rooms\n✅bigger\n✅living walls\n✅Zoom rooms\n✅ample couch space\n\nWhat more could you want? https://t.co/vtltZgTY79",
