      },
      "text": "Microsoft's shift from a dev-ignorant company to a dev-reverent org (Github, VS Code, etc) is one for the history books.\n\nTwo HN posts 8 yrs apart\n\n2010: Why do programmers hate MSFT?\n2018: Is VS Code the Emacs of the 21st century?\n\nKudos to @satyanadella, and lately @natfriedman https://t.co/CuJ4bjC19u",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1193284265225551872"
    },
