      },
      "text": "Hilarious thing someone noticed at dinner yesterday—\n\nIn SF, folks will say they are angel investing because they enjoy \"giving back\".\n\nIn no other context is investing money for returns \"giving back\" 🙃",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1192262719933542401"
