        "like_count": 85,
        "quote_count": 2,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 9
      },
      "text": "San Francisco is a uniquely non-transactional city, compared to NY, LA, Chicago, etc.\n\nMost people are successful through non-transactional value creation (building vs. making deals).\n\nAnd all the future value is in future things people build, so no reason to pinch pennies.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1191117054914383873"
    },
