        "quote_count": 1,
        "reply_count": 7,
        "retweet_count": 10
      },
      "text": "All the best work I've ever done is late at night [between 12am and 6am], under the gun, where it was either due ASAP or the next morning.\n\nIn my experience, there is nothing more clarifying than time pressure.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1190094275142443010"
